   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Home Improvement Loan P.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Husl&#xe5;n CHF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med programmet &#xe4;r att etablera samh&#xe4;llsbaserade f&#xf6;reningar i 14 samh&#xe4;llen, vilka kommer att bist&#xe5; sina medlemmar med mindre krediter f&#xf6;r hus&#xe5;terbyggnad, reparationer och inkomstgenererande aktiviteter. Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let med insatsen &#xe4;r att etablera en lokal finansiell institution f&#xf6;r att ansvara f&#xf6;r en &quot;rullande&quot; fond f&#xf6;r ovanst&#xe5;ende aktiviteter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to establish community-based associations in 14 municipalities, which will provide their members with small credits for house reconstruction, housing repair and income generating activities. The overall goal is to establish a Community Financial Institution which will be a revolving fund for the above mentioned activities.</narrative>
  </description>
